WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,240
Or maybe the former Emperor has no regard for these small fish and shrimps at home.

2
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:06,900
All my people are dead

3
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:10,380
There is no hegemony in the Prime Minister's Office, so there is only one explanation.

4
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:14,850
It seems that the Prime Minister's Office is going to kill everyone.

5
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:17,290
Master, how about we run away?

6
00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:19,650
I was very reluctant to leave An Yuanbo Mansion before.

7
00:00:19,930 --> 00:00:21,330
Because this is my home

8
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:24,690
But now the young master is back and the young master is here

9
00:00:24,810 --> 00:00:26,570
Anywhere can be home

10
00:00:27,130 --> 00:00:30,450
So I won’t be so resistant to leaving, okay?

11
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:32,410
It seems that the only way is to run.

12
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:33,650
For me now

13
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,570
Although I can continue to stay alone with my newly acquired identity, what can I do?

14
00:00:37,690 --> 00:00:40,050
Watching my enemies make trouble alone in the land as a blessing

15
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:41,450
And no matter what

16
00:00:41,730 --> 00:00:43,330
My status as a local independent is still in danger

17
00:00:43,490 --> 00:00:46,210
What if someone discovers Jiu'er after a long time?

18
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:48,190
You wait here first

19
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:51,140
Emperor Daqian will definitely not let me go by then.

20
00:00:51,850 --> 00:00:56,780
So staying away from this place of right and wrong is the best choice at the moment.

21
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,860
There are some things you must take with you before leaving.
